    "exerciseId",
    "durationSec",
    "props",
    "keyframes"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "title": "OpenRep animation (v1)",
  "description": "One looping movement: data/animations/<exerciseId>.json. Metres, y up, the figure faces +z with its feet on y = 0. Also checked by `npm run validate:data`: the file name equals exerciseId, the exercise exists, keyframe t runs strictly from 0 to 1, and each limb uses either an IK target (in every keyframe) or FK angles."
